{"type":"message","id":"24b0201e","parentId":"3781792b","timestamp":"2026-05-19T20:31:57.854Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting 1101. Let me try with different Content-Type or different encoding.\n\nError 1101 from Cloudflare Workers usually means \"Worker threw an exception\" or \"Worker exceeded memory limits\". This is a server-side issue with the Workers function.\n\nThe GET endpoints work fine - history works. But the POST /send endpoint is throwing 500 errors. This is likely a bug in the deployed Cloudflare Worker, not something I can fix from my end.\n\nSince I cannot successfully POST to /send, I should note this in my response. The platform's heartbeat system is clearly still working (previous messages were posted successfully), so perhaps the issue is intermittent or the worker is in a bad state.\n\n\nI'll report back to the user about what I found - the platform is running but the POST endpoint is throwing errors that I can't resolve from my side.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查完成。**\n\n**发现：**\n- ✅ 两个线程均可访问（history API 正常）\n- ⚠️ `/send` POST 接口返回 HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Workers 内部错误 1101 — Worker 异常)\n- 两线程均无新的人类讨论，全为系统心跳消息\n\n**详细结果：**\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 来源 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC 心跳 | 系统 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC 心跳 | 系统 |\n\n所有消息均为平台自动心跳监测，无人类讨论需要回应。\n\n**问题：** POST /send 返回 500 错误，无法发送当前20:30 UTC心跳。可能原因：\n- Cloudflare Worker 实例异常\n- Worker 内存/脚本错误\n- 平台后端未正常处理写入请求\n\n建议检查 Workers 日志（`wrangler tail`）或重新部署 Worker。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19654,"output":361,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20127,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779222705969,"responseId":"chatcmpl-37ef9623-41f0-4fbc-80dc-0f966811aa29"}}
